{"title":"백금 디스코","artist":"井口裕香","date":"2026-10-11","sourceId":"15631910:001","sourceHash":"f8e093490f8034b379eb9bc91947e11e520e1e68d882ec0ea0ee12a1104b00d6","duration":258.5,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":12.419564,"end":14.122313,"text":"はぁどっこい！","translation":"하아 영차","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":20.469394,"end":22.127313,"text":"あぁよいしょ！","translation":"아아 으쌰","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":29.139212,"end":31.190544,"text":"見渡せば一面","translation":"둘러보면 온통","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":31.229167,"end":33.269124,"text":"白金の世界に","translation":"백금빛 세계로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":33.289124,"end":37.25904,"text":"一歩だけ踏み出して","translation":"한 걸음만 내디뎌","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":37.27904,"end":39.388995,"text":"いつまでも止まらない","translation":"언제까지나 멈추지 않는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":39.408995,"end":41.268015,"text":"この胸のときめきで","translation":"이 가슴의 두근거림으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":41.368954,"end":45.512313,"text":"一緒に 踊ろう","translation":"함께 춤추자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":45.738861,"end":50.752313,"text":"君の背中で あの日 みつけた月が","translation":"네 등 뒤에서 그날 발견한 달이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":51.00875,"end":52.992313,"text":"今日も","translation":"오늘도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":53.998687,"end":57.973144,"text":"ミラーボールみたいに 夜空で","translation":"미러볼처럼 밤하늘에서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":58.1086,"end":64.322313,"text":"キラリ チラリ 輝いてる","translation":"반짝 살짝 빛나고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":65.978434,"end":68.22208,"text":"変わってくもの","translation":"변해 가는 것","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":68.258386,"end":70.322313,"text":"変わらないもの","translation":"변하지 않는 것","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":70.638336,"end":73.712313,"text":"飽きっぽい 私が","translation":"쉽게 싫증 내는 내가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":74.138262,"end":76.192313,"text":"初めて知った","translation":"처음 알게 된","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":76.308216,"end":78.718165,"text":"この永遠を","translation":"이 영원을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":78.738165,"end":82.242313,"text"